id: E081
trigger_tool: clang|gcc
phase: compilation
error_signature: pthread_cancel.*undeclared|pthread_setcanceltype.*undeclared|pthread_setcancelstate.*undeclared
severity: 3
category: platform-api-missing
match_keywords: pthread_cancel, pthread_setcanceltype, pthread_setcancelstate, undeclared identifier, HarmonyOS, OpenMP
title: HarmonyOS 缺少 pthread_cancel 系列函数
root_cause: HarmonyOS 内核不支持 POSIX 线程取消机制(pthread_cancel, pthread_setcanceltype, pthread_setcancelstate)，与 Android 类似
affected_scope: 使用 pthread_cancel 的多线程软件，特别是 OpenMP 运行时库(libomp)和其他线程管理库
verification_cmd: grep -r "pthread_cancel\|pthread_setcancel" /data/service/hnp/ohos-sdk.org/*/ohos/native/llvm/sysroot/usr/include/pthread.h || echo "Not found in HarmonyOS pthread.h"
rec_priority: 1
rec_description: 添加条件编译，类似 Android 处理：在定义 KMP_CANCEL_THREADS 的位置添加 #ifdef __OHOS__ 守卫并 undef 该宏
rec_command: echo "需要手动修复：在源码中添加 #if defined(__ANDROID__) || defined(__OHOS__) #undef KMP_CANCEL_THREADS #endif"
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: source-edit
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_description: 通过 CMake 选项禁用线程取消功能（如果软件支持）
fallback_command: cmake -DENABLE_THREAD_CANCEL=OFF ...
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: manual
forbid_1_pattern: pthread_cancel\(.*\)
forbid_1_reason: HarmonyOS 不支持 pthread_cancel，直接调用会导致编译失败
forbid_1_consequence: 编译失败，undeclared identifier 错误
principles: R8-source-guard
similar_to: [E002-tmp-readonly, E046-chmod-selinux]
source_event: libomp-15.0.4 编译任务
draft: true
contributor_id: C21A
